const a="Kaiwhakarato",t="Tauira",J="Roa",i="Reo o te whakar\u0101popototanga",o="Poto",e="Waenga",L="Roa",n="Tautuhinga",r="T\u0101rua",h="Kua t\u0101ruatia",u="Whakar\u0101popoto an\u014D",s="Ngana an\u014D",k="E whakar\u0101popoto ana\u2026",_="P\u0101whiritia te tohu o te toronga hei whakar\u0101popoto i t\u0113nei wh\u0101rangi.",g="He roa t\u0113nei wh\u0101rangi; ko te w\u0101hanga tuatahi anake i whakar\u0101popototia.",l="K\u0101ore e taea te p\u0101nui i t\u0113nei wh\u0101rangi. K\u0101ore e tautokona ng\u0101 wh\u0101rangi p\u016Btirotiro, te Chrome Web Store me ng\u0101 PDF.",p="K\u0101ore he kuputuhi tuhinga i kitea i t\u0113nei wh\u0101rangi.",c="P\u0101whiritia te tohu o te toronga hei whakar\u0101popoto i t\u0113nei wh\u0101rangi. Ina neke te ripa ki t\u0113tahi atu wh\u0101rangi, me p\u0101whiri an\u014D kia taea e te toronga te p\u0101nui.",m="K\u0101ore i t\u0101utahia te w\u0101hanga paetata, k\u0101ore r\u0101nei e whakautu ana. I te k\u014Dpaki o te toronga, whakahaerehia: ./native-host/install.sh",d="K\u0101ore i kitea a Claude Code. T\u0101utahia, k\u0101tahi ka whakahaere an\u014D i ./native-host/install.sh",w="K\u0101ore an\u014D a Claude Code kia takiuru. Whakahaerehia a claude i t\u0113tahi k\u0101peka, ka takiuru ai.",K="K\u0101ore an\u014D a Codex kia takiuru. Whakahaerehia a codex login i t\u0113tahi k\u0101peka.",C="K\u0101ore e taea t\u014D mahere ChatGPT te whakamahi m\u014D t\u0113nei. K\u014Dwhiria t\u0113tahi atu kaiwhakarato.",x="Kua tae koe ki te tepe whakamahi o t\u014D mahere. Ngana an\u014D \u0101 muri ake, k\u014Dwhiria r\u0101nei t\u0113tahi atu kaiwhakarato.",W="I rahua te kaiwhakarato i a ia e tuhi ana i te whakar\u0101popototanga. Ngana an\u014D.",P="K\u0101ore i kitea a Codex. T\u0101utahia, k\u0101tahi ka whakahaere an\u014D i ./native-host/install.sh",T="Ng\u0101 tautuhinga o Browse Resume AI",v="Ng\u0101 taunoa",I="Whakaaturia ng\u0101 whakar\u0101popototanga ki",N="Paewhiri taha",R="Matapihi puta ake",f="Kua rite"